Lei de Condomínios e Incorporações (Lei 4.591/1964), Lei 9.514/1997 (Sistema de Financiamento Imobiliário, alienação fiduciária de imóvel) and Decreto-Lei 911/1969 (alienação fiduciária em garantia) verified 2026-10-31: replay of each act's annotated Planalto page (39 versions) against Planalto's consolidated pages (l4591compilado.htm, del0911compilado.htm) and, for Lei 9.514 (no consolidated page), the unstruck text of its page: Lei 9.514 0 differences; Lei 4.591 1 (the consolidated page keeps MP 1.085/2021's art. 33 parágrafo único beside Lei 14.382/2022's) and DL 911 2 (the ementa set as a heading), all explained in decisions; 0 problems. In-force days from the acts' own clauses (publication). Hand facts from the official pages: MP 2.221/2001 stood (EC 32 art. 2) until Lei 10.931/2004 revoked it; MP 656/2014's change to Lei 9.514 in force on publication 8.10.2014 (its art. 55 III; the 1.1.2015 day in art. 55 I is for its art. 3 only); DL 911 art. 5 parágrafo único 1969 wording ends with Lei 6.071/1974. Vigência fallback audit clean; duplicate-label, duplicate-line and note-leak checks clean (only '(revogado)' placeholders); parse twice identical (sha256 bec3bdce); merged scratch build 85 acts, 1856 versions, 1600 commits, check.py 0 mismatches, 0 trailer errors, --compare identical, audit_push clean on main and futuro.
